OL,3,ACharles said Diana would be forgotten
OL,4,A'soon enough', Earl Spencer claims in
OL,5,Abook
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarl Spencer, the brother of Diana,
OL,8,FPrincess of Wales, has claimed King
OL,9,FCharles said "we'll forget her soon
OL,10,Fenough" days after her death, in an
OL,11,Fextract from his upcoming memoir
OL,12,Fpublished by the Daily Mail.
OL,14,FHe claimed the then-Prince of Wales
OL,15,Fsubjected him to a "stream of anger"
OL,16,Fafter he insisted Diana would not have
OL,17,Fwanted Princes William and Harry, then
OL,18,Faged 15 and 12, to have to walk in her
OL,19,Ffuneral procession.
OL,21,FBuckingham Palace has strongly pushed
OL,22,Fback against the claim.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
