OL,3,AEU chief backs plan for Canada to
OL,4,Abecome 'associate member'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe president of the European
OL,7,FCommission has backed proposals for
OL,8,FCanada to become the EU's first
OL,9,F"associate member".
OL,11,FUrsula von der Leyen told the European
OL,12,FParliament on Wednesday she wanted to
OL,13,Fwork on "opening the door" for Canada,
OL,14,Fwhich would involve closer ties on
OL,15,Fvarious key sectors.
OL,17,FCanadian Prime Minister Mark Carney
OL,18,Flast week spoke of seeking a "unique
OL,19,Falliance" with the EU. The country
OL,20,Fcurrently faces tense relations with
OL,21,Fthe US, compounded by an intensifying
OL,22,Fdispute over trade.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
