OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AEU chief backs plan for Canada to
OL,4,Abecome 'associate member'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWithout mentioning US President Donald
OL,7,FTrump by name, von der Leyen said
OL,8,Foffering Canada some sort of EU
OL,9,Fmembership was "not a partnership
OL,10,Fagainst anyone else, but for our common
OL,11,Fstrength".
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
