OL,3,AEight children among 21 killed after
OL,4,Awar-damaged Gaza building collapses,
OL,5,Arescuers say
OL,6,
OL,7,FUN and Egyptian teams joined the search
OL,8,Ffor survivors, which was slow due to a
OL,9,Flack of equipment. Initially, rescuers
OL,10,Ffrom the Hamas-run Civil Defence agency
OL,11,Fhad to use their bare hands.
OL,13,FOn Wednesday afternoon, they said they
OL,14,Fhad ended the operation after taking 45
OL,15,Finjured people to hospitals.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/38
